<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia approves sixth closed-end offshore fund.</title>
<headline>Tunisia approves sixth closed-end offshore fund.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has approved a sixth offshore closed-end investment fund, officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said the new fund was run by the Eagle Investment Company and managed by Fathi Ben Bouzid who signed an agreement for its establishment with the Finance Ministry.</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
